Subject: [PATCH] fix(connector): require nonce-bound CredSSP version 5 or
 later

---
 crates/ironrdp-connector/src/credssp.rs       |  18 ++
 .../tests/connector/credssp.rs                | 169 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../tests/connector/mod.rs                    |   1 +
 3 files changed, 188 insertions(+)
